        "original_id": "20c25841-e7ca-5b9a-95a6-832daf40e8bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mark Witzigreuter\n- Roles: singer-songwriters\n- Projects: The Ready Set, Cell, I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming, Free Money\n- Places: Fort Wayne, Indiana, New York\n- Topics: American electropop, grunge, college rock, alternative, cover songs\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter was born on November 14, 1989.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is an American singer-songwriter from Fort Wayne, Indiana.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is professionally known as The Ready Set.\n- Cell were a New York-based band.\n- Cell were often labeled grunge because of the time period in which they existed.\n- College rock or alternative is described as a more apt label for Cell than grunge.\n- I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming is the second studio album by American electropop singer-songwriter The Ready Set.\n- The song Free Money was covered by Penetration on the album Moving Targets.\n- The song Free Money was later covered by Cell as a B-side.",
